<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimate Monday's hog slaughter from 329,000 to 343,000 head versus 331,000 a week ago and 351,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 117,000 to 120,000 head against 116,000 a week ago and 129,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>--Bob Burgdorfer, 312-408-8720</p>
